OL,3,GNEWSASeven-week chain ferry closure due
OL,4,Ato begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major refit of a chain ferry is due
OL,7,Fto get under way on Monday, with the
OL,8,Fservice expected to be out of action
OL,9,Ffor about seven weeks.
OL,11,FThe Sandbanks Ferry, which runs across
OL,12,Fthe entrance to Poole Harbour between
OL,13,FSandbanks and Studland, will undergo a
OL,14,Fscheduled maintenance programme after
OL,15,Fits final crossing from Shell Bay at
OL,16,F23:10 GMT on Sunday.
OL,18,FThe work will be carried out at Poole
OL,19,FQuay, Dorset, and in Falmouth,
OL,20,FCornwall, with the timetable subject to
OL,21,Fweather and sea conditions.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
