OL,3,GNEWSASeven-week chain ferry closure due
OL,4,Ato begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaintenance work on the ferry is
OL,7,Fcarried out every two years,
OL,8,Falternating between major and minor
OL,9,Frefits. Its last major overhaul took
OL,10,Fplace in 2022.
